&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a team of software engineers that owns a core part of our AI-powered manufacturing marketplace. In this role, you will be accountable for both what the team ships and how its engineers grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Xometry connects buyers who need custom parts with a global network of manufacturers, with our platform handling instant quoting, pricing, order routing, supplier management, and payments. Reporting to the Director of Engineering, you will manage engineers directly, own your team&#39;s roadmap and operations, and work closely with product, design, and operations partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;You will be accountable for your team&#39;s delivery, the reliability of its systems, and the growth of every engineer on it, driving high engineering standards and cross-functional alignment from our Munich, Germany location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How You&#39;ll Contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;People and Organization:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Hire, onboard, coach, and retain a team of engineers, from early-career to senior and staff&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Set clear expectations, give timely feedback, and run fair performance and promotion processes; address underperformance directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Grow senior engineers into technical leaders and build a pipeline of future team leads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Build a team culture of ownership, psychological safety, and high engineering standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Delivery and Execution:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the team&#39;s roadmap: plan, size, sequence, and de-risk work, and deliver on commitments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Agree on dates and outcomes with product partners, and surface trade-offs and risks early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Run operational excellence: availability, latency, on-call health, incident reviews, resiliency, and cost efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Use metrics (delivery predictability, quality, customer impact) to find problems and to show progress&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Technical Strategy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Set the technical direction for your team&#39;s systems for the next 1–2 years, including build-versus-buy decisions and managing technical debt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Review designs and key technical decisions for scalability, security, data integrity, and maintainability, and dive deep when needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Apply machine learning and automation where they improve quoting accuracy, pricing, routing, or supplier matching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Work with principal engineers and peer managers to align on shared platforms and standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Work with product, design, data science, operations, and finance to define problems and measurable goals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Represent your team in planning, budget, and headcount discussions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Resolve dependencies with neighboring teams and escalate early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to Xometry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience: 8+ years of software engineering experience, including 3+ years managing software engineers directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Production Delivery: Track record of leading a team that delivered complex systems in production with clear business impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence: Experience owning operational health, including on-call, incident response, SLAs, resiliency, and cost management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Team Building &amp;amp; Coaching: Strong hiring and coaching record with proven success building a team, raising the bar, and growing engineers into larger roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Communication: Clear written and verbal communication with product leaders, executives, and engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;Education: Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience (Master&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field is preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot;&gt;Location: Ability to work from Munich, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience in a two-sided marketplace, e-commerce, supply chain, or manufacturing technology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience with large-scale data platforms, workflow engines, or payments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Experience leading through acquisition, integration, or a major re-platforming&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Background at a company that nurtures ownership and high-bar hiring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_cc45f66316188860-101&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid, 2-3 days per week in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary structure: base salary + annual bonus + RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 PTOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team spirit and friendly atmosphere:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;we work in an open, friendly and trusting environment that welcomes initiative. In the Xometry team, everyone is ready to help and support in difficult times, and we always celebrate victories together and appreciate the contribution of everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development opportunities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;we are a fast growing company, each new task is an interesting challenge for the team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;ongoing free of charge well-being activities for our people, charity projects worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;speed and flexibility are some of our advantages, allowing us to achieve amazing results. We have flexible processes and planning, we can respond to rapidly changing conditions and remain effective in the face of uncertainty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Well structured onboarding plan for new employees combining all in one process, technology, and systems components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2516&quot; data-end=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Please submit your &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;CV in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
